{"body":[{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"According to public sources, this statement should ideally be unique to each applicant. So you write it yourself, in free form.","underline":false}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"The statement should include: ","underline":false}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"your individual entrepreneur details;","underline":false}],"type":"bulleted_list_item"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"a sentence stating that as of __ (the date of your application) only one person has worked or works in the individual entrepreneurship ","underline":false},{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":true,"strikethrough":false,"text":"your name","underline":false},{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":", with that person's details (full name, date of birth, passport details);","underline":false}],"type":"bulleted_list_item"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"Date and signature","underline":false}],"type":"bulleted_list_item"},{"type":"divider"},{"children":[{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"I wrote the statement in English, then (just in case) had it translated and notarized.","underline":false}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"Although the statement was only 2 sentences long, translating and notarizing it cost more than doing the same for my passport.","underline":false}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"In public sources, people said you can translate it into Georgian yourself → print it and sign it. I assume that would have worked too, but I chose to spend an extra ~47 GEL on the translator and the notary.","underline":false}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rich_text":[{"bold":false,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"Below is a screenshot of the statement I wrote. Please don't copy it word for word — write your own. It is here only as an example.","underline":false}],"type":"paragraph"},{"caption":[],"type":"image","url":"https://ozjgnsthtftrvayduioc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guide-assets/georgia-residence-permit/59b183379a0076d76ccfa1eedc9dd20dc5debbb2185dd965b7022045af5e76bd.png"}],"icon":{"emoji":"💡"},"rich_text":[{"bold":true,"code":false,"color":"default","italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"text":"My case (Dmitriy S.)","underline":false}],"type":"callout"}],"lang":"en","title":"Statement of no employees (free form)"}